From 3ddf285bc1e50d6e15725457547927a4c6a521c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 22:30:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: hide real-user identity from Settings for the
 decoy session

Squash of former patches:

- 0001 sovereignos: route Settings Storage screen through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0002 sovereignos: route Settings multi-user UI hints through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0003 sovereignos: route WifiUtils#isCurrentUserNetworkOwner through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0004 sovereignos: fix Settings Users screen to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0005 sovereignos: don't name another real user in storage move/migrate dialogs
- 0006 sovereignos: fix Wi-Fi shared badge/dialog and factory-reset warning to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0007 sovereignos: fix Utils.isProfileOrDeviceOwner to use getUsersForUiDisplay
---
